{"id":"94cc6e7e3caa17f9","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive.md","title":"fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive — Kleene T Predicate Is Primitive Recursive","display":"fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive — Kleene T Predicate Is Primitive Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive","aliases":["88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive"],"display":"fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive — Kleene T Predicate Is Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","[[88-df-tm-run-encoding]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive — Kleene T Predicate Is Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span> (program arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (the fixed standard syntactic machine numbering from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>, whose validation, projections and transition lookup are primitive recursive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (characteristic function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}\\)</span> (arity-indexed primitive-recursive predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}(\\chi_{T_k})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}(\\chi_{T_k})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对给定运行码，长度、各配置、初始配置、逐步转移、停机状态及输出值\n都通过有界解码检查；标准句法机器编号的解码和转移查询也是原始递归的。</li>\n<li>该事实为正规形式定理中无界最小化之前的矩阵提供精确来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-run-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b301b626e1a834ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-run-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (the fixed standard syntactic machine numbering from [[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]], whose validation, projections and transition lookup are primitive recursive)","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ (characteristic function, see [[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_{k+2}(\\chi_{T_k})","display":true}],"bytes":1375,"backlinks":[{"id":"f29bba901d666547","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["5d2dec526682fb65","b301b626e1a834ac","2f808bc294509a7d","b955b7851c500bfe"]}